## 🔬 TECHNICAL EXPLANATION

- Tickets are deterministic PDAs derived from:
  - draw
  - user
  - ticket index  
  → enforced uniqueness at the runtime level

- Randomness is generated via VRF  
  → outcome cannot be predicted or manipulated

- Settlement uses batching  
  → scalable within Solana compute limits

- Payouts come directly from program-controlled vaults  
  → no custody risk

- All state transitions are enforced on-chain  
  → no manual intervention possible

